            "hi": "$\\frac{x^2}{x^{1/2}} = x^{2 - 1/2} = x^{3/2}$, और $x > 0$ के लिए $g(x) \\ne 0$ (NCERT §2.4.2 (v), Example 17)।"
          }
        ],
